    "zipball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/Raysance/codex-companion/zipball/v2.0.1",
    "body": "Codex Companion combines local usage analytics and provider migration in one native macOS app.\n\n- Token summaries by chat and model, with turn and request details and CSV export.\n- Quota consumption, allowance equivalents, reset history and expected reset time.\n- Chinese/English word clouds, searchable word frequencies and input history.\n- Current-storage migration fixes, local-host isolation, consistent backups and WAL-safe rollback.\n- One application and Swift executable: `CodexCompanion`.\n\nAnalytics stay local. Quota attribution is approximate; missing logs and legacy estimates are shown explicitly.\n\nRequires macOS 14 or later on Apple Silicon. The app is ad-hoc signed and is not notarized.\n\nValidation: eight fixture suites, GitHub CI, release build, bundle signature and native UI checks passed.\n\nSHA-256 (`CodexCompanion-v2.0.1-macOS-arm64.zip`):\n`93663e61c3bb26d42397089e7e293eea5a49ef317d642af66221d91bdb3fe8e9`\n"
