    "body": "Initial English release.\n\nCodex Provider Migrator is a native macOS utility that safely batch-migrates model provider metadata for local Codex sessions. It updates session JSONL files, the recovery state database, and the task catalog together.\n\nHighlights:\n- Batch selection and project filtering\n- Active and archived session support\n- Full backup and automatic rollback attempt\n- Target provider validation\n- Post-migration JSONL and SQLite integrity checks\n- Protection against writes while Codex is running\n\nRequirements: macOS 14 or later on Apple Silicon.\n\nSHA-256: b427ce7ee083d22a64c71084c72734e24789b0f0700697f53226d24f84c97d6e"
